-- =====================================================================
-- Mandal Masala Bhandar  |  01  TABLES, CONSTRAINTS, INDEXES, TRIGGERS
-- Run in: Supabase Dashboard -> SQL Editor (or use the combined setup.sql)
-- Safe to run more than once.
